      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"goblin-like unpredictability\"? I was just asking about the microbiology of the fermentation process. Can we just stick to the science of the protein and temperature interactions? I need to know if I should switch to a more consistent flour or if I need to adjust my proofing environment to stabilize the pH.",
      "source": "evaluator"
